<title>INDIA: India's NEPC-Micon 96/97 net falls.</title>
<headline>India's NEPC-Micon 96/97 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>NEPC-Micon Ltd reported a sharp fall in net profit in 1996/97 (April-March) to 533.8 million rupees from 1.01 billion in the previous year, the Press Trust of India (PTI) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The company is offering a dividend of 15 percent for 1996/97, down from 30 percent, the news agency said.</p>
<p>Turnover fell to 4.38 billion rupees from 7.29 billion, PTI said.</p>
<p>The agency quoted company officials as attributing the fall in turnover to the sluggish economy and tight liquidity.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
